    "passage": "To: wartono@sumatrapetroleum.co.id\n\nFrom: isuzuki@archaeologyresearchguild.org\n\nDate: 21 May\n\nSubject: Course enrollment\n\nDear Ms. Wartono,\n\nIt was a pleasure meeting you at the symposium of the A rchaeology Research Guild (ARG).\n---【131】 ______-- the conclusion of the symposium, you inquired about enrolling in one of ARG's\ncontinuing education courses. I am confident that taking one of our courses would be a\n---【132】 ______-- experience for you. The course registration fee for nonmembers is $500.\nHowever, ARG members receive a 10 percent discount. If you are interested in ---【133】 ______-- us,\nwe'd love to hear from you. ---【134】 ______----. I am happy to assist with any additional details you\nmight need.\n\nSincerely,\n\nIsaku Suzuki, Membership Coordinator A rchaeology Research Guild",
